[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="ActionDef" format=3]

; Story 6.1: Ghost Echo, the L->N combo's action (GDD 0/30/8). Replaces Null Dodge on the [L, N]
; window; NULL's 120-frame cooldown applies (D-S26-3). Intangible on frames 1-30 (the existing
; invulnerable-frame path, D-S61-2), hits nothing, does not move, does not arm Clean Catch. On its
; start it leaves a 120-frame decoy at the start point that bosses aim at (decoy_frames, D-S61-3).

